  "id": "greek-chicken-kabobs",
  "name": "Greek Chicken Kabobs",
  "subtitle": "Yogurt-marinated chicken with lemon, herbs, and vegetables",
  "description": "Chicken, onion, and bell pepper are coated in a tangy yogurt-feta marinade, chilled, and grilled until cooked through.",
